1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,200
He'd already made a fortune in phones.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:07,400
Then he bet it all again.

3
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:13,000
Lei Jun, founder of Xiaomi — xiǎomǐ, "little rice."

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,500
A car: the last big project of his life.

5
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:21,500
He promised up to $10 billion — his own company's cash.

6
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:26,500
Everyone said he was too late. Tesla was years ahead.

7
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:30,300
Then in 2024, the car launched.

8
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:33,700
Nearly 90,000 sold in a single day.

9
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:39,700
Bet your whole legacy on one last idea — or quit while you're winning?
